Okay, let me start by saying that this game is a blast. I've enjoyed it extinsively, and regret none of the hours I have put into it. With that being said, there are some issues, which as of today has ruined the game for me in its current build. After a week of searching high and low for vehicle parts I completed my dune buggy, {which is pretty much End Game right now}
And I was thrilled. Late last night I found my last tire and couldn't wait to play today to give her a test drive. I climbed on in,  started her up and began to drive down the hill from my garage. The car flipped, no big deal, got out, equipped my spear, flipped the car. Car flew thousands of feet into the air and landed atop an unreachable mountain. While trying to get to the top of the mountain to retreive my car, I got stuck in a hole and had to lose everything in my backpack. Safe to say, I'm done for now. Good game, excited for its future, but screw this steaming pile of feces.
